### `SDKRateLimitEvent`

當工作階段遇到速率限制時發出。

```
type SDKRateLimitEvent = {
  type: "rate_limit_event";
  rate_limit_info: {
    status: "allowed" | "allowed_warning" | "rejected";
    resetsAt?: number;
    utilization?: number;
    errorCode?: "credits_required";
    canUserPurchaseCredits?: boolean;
    hasChargeableSavedPaymentMethod?: boolean;
